{"id":"611491","name":"韭菜鸡蛋水煎包","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/611491/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"三个"},{"name":"红薯粉条","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水(40度左右)","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"摘好的韭菜洗净，控干水分。","img":"images/611491/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/611491/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红薯粉条备用。","img":"images/611491/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用清水泡软，捞出，沥干水分，切碎。","img":"images/611491/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋炒好，捣碎，备用。","img":"images/611491/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盆中，如图所示。","img":"images/611491/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量盐、少许老抽、五香粉和鸡精，滴几滴橄榄油，拌匀即可。","img":"images/611491/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/611491/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搓成长条状。","img":"images/611491/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/611491/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀成薄圆饼状。","img":"images/611491/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/611491/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/611491/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"平底锅烧热放少许油，摆好，如图所示。","img":"images/611491/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"倒入搅好的面粉水，用中小火煎至锅中无水，煎成两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/611491/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/611491/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"香酥可口。","img":"images/611491/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}